WEBVTT

01:32.384 --> 01:34.318
You mustn't look at those lids
as warnings and bad omens,

01:35.487 --> 01:39.685
but as hope for a future without
the tyranny of time!

02:00.079 --> 02:02.138
What does he mean by
"steal all time?"

02:03.182 --> 02:04.649
He calls himself the Bandit King?

02:14.293 --> 02:16.420
That so-called Bandit King

02:17.563 --> 02:20.726
thinks he will steal from
right under our noses?

02:22.768 --> 02:24.827
C'mon, really, Master Gear.

02:25.404 --> 02:29.238
Eggnog Boys, I want you to deal
with that sneaky pet of his.

02:30.275 --> 02:31.742
You can take care of that, can't you?

02:32.177 --> 02:37.046
Are you giving me a royal order
to take care of him?

02:38.884 --> 02:44.516
If that's what you want,
you can count on us.

02:46.592 --> 02:48.059
Let's go!

02:53.532 --> 02:56.865
Don't think you'll get away with this
so easily, Bandit King.

03:05.878 --> 03:10.542
The Adonis Capital of Time, Part 2

03:14.853 --> 03:16.912
It looks like they've finally
begun to move.

03:27.099 --> 03:30.227
We better hurry up and start
stealing while we can.

03:30.636 --> 03:32.771
I thought I sent you a mission report.

03:32.771 --> 03:34.339
You should know that we must wait
for the proper welcome.

03:34.339 --> 03:35.774
Stop being rude!

03:35.774 --> 03:39.011
Maybe I would if you ever did anything
that demanded respect.

03:39.011 --> 03:42.105
Hey by the way, mind if talk
to these guys first?

03:42.514 --> 03:43.776
What?!

03:50.022 --> 03:52.684
Don't worry, tweety bird.
I'm right behind you!

03:55.561 --> 03:58.831
Jing! Isn't the Clock Tower that way?!
Where are you going?

03:58.831 --> 04:01.095
Where, oh, where is my tweety?!

04:02.201 --> 04:05.804
We won't be able to get past the
front gates from the streets.

04:05.804 --> 04:08.932
First, we must stop the clock.

04:10.542 --> 04:13.340
So is that what you meant
by stealing time?

04:14.680 --> 04:16.147
You lost?

04:17.382 --> 04:18.849
Here little birdie, birdie!

04:19.952 --> 04:22.887
I can see your scared
little tail running!

04:40.639 --> 04:43.308
We've got to stop that. It's the city's
power source.

04:43.308 --> 04:44.741
How do we do that?

04:45.143 --> 04:46.545
Oh, is this what Postino
was talking about?

04:46.545 --> 04:49.343
That's right. We need to rework
the sand with magic powder.

04:49.815 --> 04:51.282
With magic powder?

04:51.750 --> 04:54.553
Did that Bandit King mean that he
thinks he's some kind of god

04:54.553 --> 04:56.316
when he said that he could
steal time and stuff?

04:56.688 --> 04:59.714
No, I think that kid is gonna use
some kind of magic.

05:01.627 --> 05:02.494
You can't have any.

05:02.494 --> 05:03.028
Why?
You can't have any.

05:03.028 --> 05:03.695
Why?

05:03.695 --> 05:07.426
Jing is neither a magician nor a god.
He's just a normal boy.

05:07.799 --> 05:12.361
He may have an illegal job,
but he's one of a kind.

05:13.405 --> 05:15.207
I owe him my life.

05:15.207 --> 05:20.076
Yeah, but he broke all the clocks,
and talks of dangerous plans.

05:23.315 --> 05:24.782
I know, but...

05:26.451 --> 05:28.544
What is it, Captain?

05:34.126 --> 05:36.185
He's exactly how I used to be.

05:39.097 --> 05:43.932
Captain, you remember? Long ago,
you used to always talk of it.

05:44.369 --> 05:46.735
You said, "Even without clocks,
the sun will still rise."

05:49.841 --> 05:53.333
Even without clocks,
the sun will still rise?

06:09.995 --> 06:12.122
They must have failed in their pursuit.

06:13.398 --> 06:15.366
Even so little one, you have
a big mouth.

06:15.801 --> 06:18.770
You say you will steal my time?

06:19.204 --> 06:21.900
You should be more frightened by
what I'm going to steal from you.

06:33.151 --> 06:35.187
What in the world happened?!

06:35.187 --> 06:36.654
I'm not sure.

06:43.996 --> 06:46.464
All of the clocks have stopped.

06:47.332 --> 06:50.301
What exactly did he mean
by "steal time?"

06:50.902 --> 06:52.369
This is...

07:07.152 --> 07:11.056
Quite a plan you've got. You've let
loose the seeds of the flowers

07:11.056 --> 07:12.858
that kept time in the hourglass.

07:12.858 --> 07:15.224
I suppose. Let's go ahead and
finish the job, shall we?

07:16.828 --> 07:18.295
Kir Royale!

07:57.936 --> 08:00.427
Sorry about this, I don't have
enough rope left.

08:00.772 --> 08:02.239
Kir Royale!

08:15.754 --> 08:17.221
How's it coming?

08:18.090 --> 08:19.624
Almost got it...

08:19.624 --> 08:21.393
There he is!

08:21.393 --> 08:22.860
Damn!

08:26.765 --> 08:28.232
I would expect nothing less
from the Bandit King.

08:29.267 --> 08:31.997
You really did steal time!

08:35.507 --> 08:37.743
Captain, everyone...

08:37.743 --> 08:39.210
Mirabelle!

08:44.382 --> 08:46.509
I always keep a spare on hand.

08:47.119 --> 08:51.656
Sorry about that, I can be a little
cheesy sometimes, Mr. Bandit King.

08:51.656 --> 08:54.022
Hey, as long as it gets us in, thanks.

08:54.760 --> 08:56.228
I want to apologize, Jing.

08:56.228 --> 09:00.065
I feel bad about how
I treated you earlier.

09:00.065 --> 09:03.228
You have opened my eyes and
brought back all my old...

09:04.136 --> 09:05.626
Well, anyway, thanks.

09:12.244 --> 09:14.303
The sun, it's rising.

09:14.946 --> 09:17.847
Yeah, and without our
annoying little clocks.

09:18.283 --> 09:20.274
Cock-a-doodle-doo!

09:34.900 --> 09:38.436
Hey, Jing, I'm ready for my
morning shot of action.

09:38.436 --> 09:39.903
Let's go!

09:43.608 --> 09:45.075
Don't drink too much.

10:09.367 --> 10:10.635
This is horrible...

10:10.635 --> 10:13.433
I can't believe that Master Gear
goes as far

10:14.306 --> 10:16.074
as to mess with these sacred grapes.

10:16.074 --> 10:19.009
Yeah, but there have got to be some
that have not yet fallen into his grasp.

10:31.890 --> 10:33.357
Found them. They're over here!

10:40.832 --> 10:44.063
How beautiful! They look so good
they almost look fake.

10:44.536 --> 10:46.470
Is this what you have been
looking for all along, Jing?

10:46.938 --> 10:48.240
What do you mean?

10:48.240 --> 10:49.867
They make the very time we live in,

10:50.275 --> 10:52.677
and bear fruit almost like a machine.

10:52.677 --> 10:54.201
They are the "Grapes of Time,"
and with just one,

10:54.846 --> 10:58.247
anyone can escape the normal
restraints of time.

10:58.750 --> 11:00.240
The last pure vine...

11:01.686 --> 11:03.153
This is a great treasure.

11:03.822 --> 11:05.653
In the sunlight the drops grow plump,

11:06.157 --> 11:08.148
and in the moonlight its
sweetness is refined.

11:08.994 --> 11:11.189
It is the only hundred percent
natural fruit.

11:11.930 --> 11:14.057
That is the only way it could have
survived such torture.

11:15.033 --> 11:17.399
Oh, I'm sure it must taste
wonderful too!

11:17.769 --> 11:19.037
Of course.

11:19.037 --> 11:21.699
Because it's a fruit that has ripened
from the seeds of freedom.

11:28.713 --> 11:31.216
You, you...

11:31.216 --> 11:32.683
You've stopped time in Adonis.

11:33.118 --> 11:34.585
My time!

11:43.361 --> 11:44.629
Watch out!

11:44.629 --> 11:46.096
Mirabelle!

11:49.467 --> 11:51.236
You almost messed up Mirabelle's
cute little braids!

11:51.236 --> 11:52.270
You'll pay for that!

11:52.270 --> 11:53.939
I'd stop worrying about her braids,

11:53.939 --> 11:55.429
and start worrying about her life
if I were you.

12:00.378 --> 12:02.714
We need to hurry up and get her
to a safe place first!

12:02.714 --> 12:04.181
Yeah!

12:30.375 --> 12:31.643
She's coming to!

12:31.643 --> 12:33.110
You'll be safe here.

12:34.813 --> 12:37.805
Don't worry, Mirabelle. Old Kir here
is going to protect you!

12:38.383 --> 12:40.180
I swear, on the rising sun!

12:42.387 --> 12:43.820
Thank you, Kir.

12:45.290 --> 12:48.157
Where are you hiding,
my little time bandit?

12:48.893 --> 12:50.360
Here we go.

12:55.767 --> 12:57.860
We weren't trying to hide from you.

12:58.236 --> 12:59.771
I see.

12:59.771 --> 13:04.175
You know that this is the top floor
of the Clock Tower, right?

13:04.175 --> 13:05.733
We know, buddy!

13:06.244 --> 13:08.269
In that case, you must already know.

13:08.780 --> 13:13.080
This is the closest room to the land
of the dead in all of Adonis.

13:17.689 --> 13:19.179
Jing, Kir?

13:32.170 --> 13:35.298
Hiding again? You sure do
have a lot of energy.

13:35.840 --> 13:38.308
But playtime is over!

13:41.079 --> 13:44.173
What?! What is he going to do by
making the room pitch black?!

13:50.455 --> 13:54.092
You're like a helpless little child
in this black darkness.

13:54.092 --> 13:55.760
I'll save your time and tell you now.

13:55.760 --> 13:58.063
That trick where you two synchronized
your heartbeats

13:58.063 --> 13:59.764
won't work again this time.

13:59.764 --> 14:01.231
Damn!

14:02.734 --> 14:03.701
Wait right there!

14:03.701 --> 14:06.499
Stopped that albatross in its tracks.

14:07.505 --> 14:09.473
What a pitiful little beast.

14:09.908 --> 14:12.274
We don't need pets interfering
with our business this time.

14:14.879 --> 14:16.779
You're not really qualified
to own a pet anyway.

14:19.084 --> 14:22.247
Sherry, why don't you give
our little friend a kiss.

14:33.465 --> 14:34.932
Over there!

14:46.311 --> 14:47.778
Jing!

14:57.021 --> 14:59.512
Run out of places to hide?

15:00.892 --> 15:02.359
It appears so.

15:05.964 --> 15:07.556
Time is up.

15:19.344 --> 15:20.811
What?!

15:21.212 --> 15:22.770
I can't hear his heartbeat!

15:34.159 --> 15:36.957
Time for lunch!

15:41.065 --> 15:44.193
Sherry! Where is the punk?!

15:45.270 --> 15:48.535
Sherry? Answer me! Sherry?!

15:55.947 --> 15:58.245
So what kind of new hairstyle do you
think would look good on her?

16:01.386 --> 16:04.923
What do you think about giving her
that new cool, shaggy look?

16:04.923 --> 16:06.447
You bastard...

16:19.537 --> 16:21.004
Sherry!

16:21.806 --> 16:23.831
Where are you going?! Where?!

16:25.076 --> 16:27.943
I'm going to find a new master
who is more dependable.

16:28.880 --> 16:30.347
You incompetent fool.

16:36.321 --> 16:42.692
Sherry!

16:50.068 --> 16:53.560
It's all over. There's nothing more
I can do. It's all over.

16:54.672 --> 16:58.472
This isn't the end.
Things are just beginning.

16:59.344 --> 17:01.574
Who? Who are you?

17:02.213 --> 17:04.078
Your job is finished here.

17:04.782 --> 17:07.273
As a reward, I might make you
one of my servants.

17:13.024 --> 17:14.787
What is he going to do?

17:15.293 --> 17:17.284
It's not our job to find out.

17:17.729 --> 17:19.397
We've got to give this one to
the Captain and the others.

17:19.397 --> 17:20.864
I guess you're right.

17:30.908 --> 17:32.375
What the...

17:57.101 --> 17:58.568
What the hell is that?!

18:05.943 --> 18:07.478
The Demon of Time!

18:07.478 --> 18:08.913
If that is really the Demon of Time,

18:08.913 --> 18:10.881
then that old man at the spa
was right all along!

18:16.421 --> 18:19.049
I thought that old man was just
full of it when he told us that!

18:23.494 --> 18:25.689
Kir! I need you for one last shot!

18:47.051 --> 18:48.518
Kir Royale!

19:11.409 --> 19:12.377
It's collapsing!

19:12.377 --> 19:13.844
Hurry for the door!

19:16.981 --> 19:18.082
Oh, no!

19:18.082 --> 19:19.450
We'll have to jump!

19:19.450 --> 19:20.218
Hurry!

19:20.218 --> 19:23.187
I'll be fine, but what are
you guys going to do?

19:23.187 --> 19:24.654
We have no choice, jump!

19:31.963 --> 19:32.730
How can you?

19:32.730 --> 19:34.095
Because!

19:44.342 --> 19:45.643
The flowers...

19:45.643 --> 19:47.110
See?

19:50.047 --> 19:53.380
Hey everyone! Forget about time
for now and let's party!

19:58.656 --> 20:01.181
It's been so long since we've
had peace here,

20:01.626 --> 20:03.227
we can finally relax.

20:03.227 --> 20:04.694
I know, you're right!

20:08.032 --> 20:09.897
Hey, where's that boy Jing at?

20:10.301 --> 20:12.963
I don't know, but he's not here.

20:14.138 --> 20:15.730
Where could he have gone?

20:17.675 --> 20:19.199
I'll ask Mirabelle, she should know.

20:19.644 --> 20:21.111
Hey, Mirabelle!

20:21.712 --> 20:25.045
Hey, you haven't seen Jing around,
have you? He's not here.

20:39.597 --> 20:40.731
Oh, it's so good!

20:40.731 --> 20:43.165
It's better than I could have
ever expected!

20:43.534 --> 20:45.092
It's the taste of freedom!

20:47.104 --> 20:49.800
But what about Mirabelle?

20:50.575 --> 20:52.042
You'll see her again soon.

20:52.410 --> 20:55.313
We'll come back and see her again.

20:55.313 --> 20:57.042
It'd be a shame not to come back
to taste these grapes again.

20:57.648 --> 20:59.250
Yes, you're right.

20:59.250 --> 21:02.879
But in the meantime, I wonder
if she'll be waiting for me?

21:03.287 --> 21:07.018
I hope she'll always be
thinking about me.

21:09.360 --> 21:11.692
Hey, Jing, wait up!
